---
// Hero.astro
---

<section class="flex flex-col items-start gap-6 pt-4" id="sobre-mi">
  {/* Terminal Tag Eyebrow */}
  <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[rgba(80,45,85,0.24)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md">
    <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#10B981] animate-ping"></span>
    <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#c084fc] tracking-wider">// PERFIL INGENIERO: DAARICK SYSTEMS</span>
    <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[rgba(246,219,192,0.65)]">|</span>
    <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#10B981]">[ ● DISPONIBLE PARA NUEVOS RETOS ]</span>
  </div>

  {/* Two-Column Grid */}
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 w-full items-stretch">
    {/* Left Narrative Block */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#ddb8ff] flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>&gt; whoami --detailed</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-[#F8F4E9] tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Hola, soy <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ddb8ff] via-[#D8B4FE] to-[#ffafd5]">Daarick</span>.<br />
          Ingeniero de Sistemas de IA &amp; Automatización.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#F6DBC0] leading-relaxed mt-2">
          Me apasiona erradicar la fricción y el tedio de las operaciones corporativas. Transformo flujos lentos y propensos al error humano en <span class="text-[#F8F4E9] font-medium border-b border-[#ddb8ff]/40">arquitecturas autónomas, limpias y deterministas</span> con FastAPI, Python y React.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Action Buttons */}
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-2">
        <a
          href="#proyectos"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[#c084fc] hover:bg-[#D8B4FE] text-[#500989] font-mono text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-[#c084fc]/20 cursor-pointer"
        >
          <span>+</span>
          <span>[ Explorar Proyectos 3D ↓ ]</span>
          <span>+</span>
        </a>

        <button
          id="hero-open-sandbox-btn"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-[rgba(80,45,85,0.24)] hover:bg-[rgba(80,45,85,0.4)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.4)] text-[#F6DBC0] hover:text-[#F8F4E9] font-mono text-xs backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer"
        >
          <span class="text-[#ddb8ff]">⚡</span>
          <span>[ Probar Ventana Sandbox ]</span>
        </button>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-xs text-[rgba(246,219,192,0.65)] pl-1">
          <span>// RUNTIME:</span>
          <span class="text-[#c084fc]">v3.4.12-prod</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Right Operational Focus Card */}
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-xl bg-[rgba(35,23,39,0.7)] border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.25)] font-mono text-xs text-[rgba(246,219,192,0.65)]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f56]"></span>
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ffbd2e]"></span>
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#27c93f]"></span>
          <span class="ml-2 text-[#ddb8ff]">runtime://daarick-profile</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#10B981]">[ ACTIVE ]</span>
      </div>

      <div class="my-auto py-4 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#ddb8ff] flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#ddb8ff] animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>// QUÉ HAGO A DIARIO:</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#F6DBC0] leading-relaxed bg-[rgba(21,10,25,0.6)] p-4 rounded-lg border border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.2)]">
          Diseño pipelines con LLMs/RAG sin alucinaciones, sincronizaciones en tiempo real con ERPs y paneles de control que ahorran cientos de horas al mes a equipos de compras, operaciones y finanzas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-[rgba(147,80,115,0.2)] flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-[rgba(246,219,192,0.65)]">
        <span>STACK: FastAPI · Python · React</span>
        <span class="text-[#c084fc]">99.9% Determinista</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.getElementById('hero-open-sandbox-btn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-inspect-modal', { detail: { projectKey: 'A' } }));
  });
</script>
